      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفْتُوحٌ</span></b>  An <i>opened,</i> or <i>unclosed,</i> [and an <i>unlocked,</i>]
door. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [And (assumed tropical:)  A <i>light,</i> or <i>bright,</i> colour;
a meaning probably post-classical. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  For other
significations, see its verb.]

